        "original_id": "5277603d-d74f-5ac3-a1f7-d0cd0a9231f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Van Gundy, Don Chaney\n- Organizations: New York Knicks, Houston Rockets, ESPN\n- Roles: head coach, color commentator\n- Events: 2001–02 New York Knicks season, Jeff Van Gundy resignation\n\nFacts:\n- During the 2001–02 New York Knicks season, the New York Knicks started with a 10–9 record before head coach Jeff Van Gundy resigned unexpectedly in December.\n- Jeff Van Gundy said he resigned because he had \"diminished focus.\"\n- Don Chaney took over as head coach of the New York Knicks after Jeff Van Gundy resigned.\n- Jeff Van Gundy returned to coaching in the 2003–04 season with the Houston Rockets.\n- Jeff Van Gundy is a color commentator for ESPN.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
